    "title": {
      "en": "2nd Boss Murder Row Hotfixed and Now Deals Real Damage",
      "es": "La segunda fila de asesinatos de jefes se reparó y ahora inflige un daño real"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "2nd Boss Murder Row Hotfixed and Now Deals Real Damage...",
      "es": "La segunda fila de asesinatos de jefes se corrigió y ahora inflige un daño real..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aca86b0a51f57.49108048\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has hotfixed the 2nd boss of Murder Row to actually deal real damage, which can make this a difficult healer check boss now. <br><br>Earlier today, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/murder-row-boss-deals-fake-damage-to-players-383347\" data-contiguous=\"true\">we reported that</a> the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1201553/fel-infused-freight\" class=\"icontiny\" data-entity=\"spell\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_ember_fel.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Fel-Infused Freight</span></a> damage on the <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=234649/zaen-bladesorrow\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Zaen Bladesorrow</span></a> encounter was \"fake damage\". It would show someone's health bar going down, but in reality, your health was actually full the entire time. This bug appeared to have been in since the start of the expansion, but it has now been hotfixed.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305345.jpg\" id=\"1305345\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305345.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.60627 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>This boss is now substantially harder for your healer and deals a very high amount of rot damage. In addition, missing a green barrel will almost certainly wipe you on high keys, so make sure to destroy them every chance you get.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has hotfixed the 2nd boss of Murder Row to actually deal real damage, which can make this a difficult healer check boss now. <br /><br />Earlier today, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/murder-row-boss-deals-fake-damage-to-players-383347\">we reported that</a> the <a href=\"/spell=1201553/fel-infused-freight\">Fel-Infused Freight</a> damage on the <a href=\"/npc=234649/zaen-bladesorrow\">Zaen Bladesorrow</a> encounter was &quot;fake damage&quot;. It would show someone's health bar going down, but in reality, your health was actually full the entire time. This bug appeared to have been in since the start of the expansion, but it has now been hotfixed.<br /><br />This boss is now substantially harder for your healer and deals a very high amount of rot damage. In addition, missing a green barrel will almost certainly wipe you on high keys, so make sure to destroy them every chance you get.</noscript>            \n        ",
